In article <1992Apr27.170155.10312@u.washington.edu> aranta@milton.u.washington.edu (Aaron Ranta) writes:
>When you get polymorphed into any non-human (or elven) monster, it is like
>getting a bonus life to mess around with.. ( sort of ) when your hit points
>as the polymorphed creature get reduced to a low enough amount you will
>return to your original human ( elven ) form ( I believe with max hit points )
>although you are quite often flashing your private parts at the hostile beasty.

It's not max hit points, it's as many hit points as you would have had if you
had been human and healed during the time you were polymorphed.  If you are
only polymorphed for a short time this can be a lot less than max hit points.
